# <%= it.ctx.name %>

A Node-RED editor plugin scaffolded with [flowup](https://github.com/wry-smile/flowup).

## UI Stack

<% if (it.ctx.clientFramework === 'vue') { %>- Vue sidebar plugin
<% } else if (it.ctx.clientFramework === 'svelte') { %>- Svelte sidebar plugin
<% } else if (it.ctx.clientFramework === 'preact') { %>- Preact sidebar plugin
<% } else if (it.ctx.clientFramework === 'solid') { %>- Solid sidebar plugin
<% } else { %>- Plain TypeScript plugin registration
<% } %>
<% if (it.ctx.unocss) { %>- UnoCSS Wind4 with a Flowup scope
<% } %>

<% if (it.ctx.clientFramework !== 'vanilla' || it.ctx.unocss) { %>- `@wry-smile/flowup/client` provides shared editor helpers.
<% if (it.ctx.clientFramework !== 'vanilla') { %>- `@wry-smile/flowup/client/<%= it.ctx.clientFramework %>` provides the framework-specific hydrate adapter.
<% } %>
<% } %>
<% if (it.ctx.clientFramework === 'vue') { %>- Vue templates include `client/hydrate.ts`.
<% } %>
<% if (it.ctx.clientFramework === 'svelte') { %>- Svelte templates include `client/App.svelte` and `client/hydrate.ts`.
<% } %>
<% if (it.ctx.clientFramework === 'preact' || it.ctx.clientFramework === 'solid') { %>- <%= it.ctx.clientFramework %> templates include TSX components and editor mount logic.
<% } %>
<% if (it.ctx.unocss) { %>- UnoCSS styles are scoped to `data-flowup-scope`; popup mount nodes need the same attribute.
<% } %>
- Shared constants are generated in `constant/index.ts`.

## Layout

```
<%= it.ctx.name %>/
├── package.json
├── flowup.config.ts
├── constant/
├── runtime/
├── client/
├── types/
├── locales/
├── icons/
└── resources/
```

## Build and Package

```
pnpm install
pnpm build
npm pack --dry-run
```

Run `pnpm dev` to build and preview this plugin in Node-RED. Source changes rebuild the package and restart Node-RED. The preview uses `dist/` as `nodesDir`; configure it with `nodeRed` in `flowup.config.ts`.

A full build generates `dist/flowup.manifest.json` for `flowup assemble`.
